<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Soccer-Result of FAI Cup quarter-final draw.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Result of FAI Cup quarter-final draw.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Football Association of Ireland (FAI) senior challenge cup quarter-final draw made on Friday. All ties will be played over the week ending March 9, 1997.</p>
<p>Bohemians vs St.Patrick's Athletic.</p>
<p>Bray Wanderers vs Shelbourne.</p>
<p>Derry City vs Cork City.</p>
<p>Waterford United vs Drogheda United.</p>
<p>--Damien Lynch, Dublin newsroom 353-1-661-3377.</p>
</text>
